bluejetty:00017849:ios.description:
Conveniently and securely manage your accounts from your mobile device from anywhere and at any time. Check your balances, view transactions, pay your bills*, transfer funds, view alerts and find ATMs and branch locations.
*A Farmers State Bank online banking account is required. To sign up for online banking, visit www.FSBankMCTN.com.
We know the importance of protecting your information, and we use security questions to verify your identity, a secure logon with an Access ID and Password, and advanced encryption technology.
We recommend the following when using your mobile device to access your financial information:
If using a web browser, logout and close your browser after each session;
If using an app, logout and close the app after each session;
Lock your phone and password-protect it;
Do not store passwords on your mobile device; and,
Delete any text message alerts that you receive.

